first time right there on set.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.458
Well, I found
some of our old footage.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.893
-What?!
-I swear.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.495
So, for the first time
in decades,

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.697
here is Tracy and I on EatsTV.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:05.965
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:09.201
-You're watching EatsTV,
your home for recipes,

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:11.670
restaurants,
and really good food.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.574
Stay tuned for tips
from the EatsTV kitchen.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.042 line:0%
