00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:58.697
-He did. Well, he had this thing
that he wanted us

00:04:58.697 --> 00:05:00.499
to have our line readings
be really fresh.

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:03.102
Right, so he didn't want us to
see our lines before the bit.

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:04.570
-That's right.
-So every time

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.806
