right there on set.

00:05:08.507 --> 00:05:09.942
Well, I found one
of our old commercials.

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:11.243
-No!
-Yes.

00:05:11.243 --> 00:05:13.245
-Oh, it's about time.
-So, here for the first time

00:05:13.245 --> 00:05:16.048
