"It's a pill, dum-dum.

00:08:42.221 --> 00:08:43.823
Just write the prescription."

00:08:43.823 --> 00:08:46.025
Then he said, "That's not
how prescriptions work."

00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:48.527
So I said, "Pwease?"
And he said, "No."

00:08:48.527 --> 00:08:50.396
