with Muscle Milk.

00:09:26.332 --> 00:09:28.834
-Soon, I weighed 600 pounds.

00:09:28.834 --> 00:09:30.836
It was a long, hard road
to lose all that weight,

00:09:30.836 --> 00:09:33.172
and I couldn't have done it
without a good friend.

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:37.242
-But after his friend escaped,
I stepped in.

00:09:37.242 --> 00:09:40.212
The rest is
rock-'n'-roll history.

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:42.047
-Thanks, Zynerma!
-Thanks, Zynerma!

00:09:42.047 --> 00:09:44.216
